        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"3835deb6-e411-4ba9-9b7c-d51a5e13c34c\",\"review_text\":\"Now with the Enhanced feature I have almost limitless music recommendation catering to my taste. Insanely good. Worth the premium.\"},{\"review_id\":\"930b9706-0b3b-4ba2-b44d-7d312fa8e5a6\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent\"},{\"review_id\":\"885b1efa-1908-4211-bfea-0e850369ff29\",\"review_text\":\"Very good app!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"b738bd94-6f77-4a7a-bf44-e241dac4ee1f\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this app 👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"b5a84f1c-f991-4038-83e4-13a3b6af2944\",\"review_text\":\"Iiighhhhjtyuy and his team are all about winning games for their players but it was not open and they would be a great fit to have them all but they were very different to them when I phone the first half I said to him and k what he was going out the game in his team is the way I phone my favourite game in my favourite place to see what the\"},{\"review_id\":\"a3b13a75-9330-485f-a5ab-665a332b827b\",\"review_text\":\"It used to be a good app, but now it just ask to upgrade to premium every time.. want to play a random song- upgrade to premium... Skip song- upgrade to premium.... We can only skip 6 song in a whole day.. And the lite version is more worse..\"},{\"review_id\":\"abfa4476-f1e8-43e6-b238-dbe6b9b7c0a7\",\"review_text\":\"Good quality of music and better performance for listening 🎧 with head phone\"},{\"review_id\":\"74decd9d-4e45-4aad-b873-c61bf5025261\",\"review_text\":\"WE HATE THIS APPS💪💪💪\"},{\"review_id\":\"53612109-5d83-4177-ac9e-2fa600d559bf\",\"review_text\":\"Very good 🌻😊\"},{\"review_id\":\"ef730aa8-289b-4622-ba74-a5eae0e8215f\",\"review_text\":\"there are no results when i search moaning female minor\"}]}"
